== Walkthrough ==

This quest begins with Cobi Frostbeard in Thurgadin. He's found in Frostbeard's Furs and Leather: After zoning in, cross both bridges, turn left towards the bank, then (at the bank) hang a right. He'll be in the second shop on the right.

You say, 'Hail, Cobi Frostbeard'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Greetings to you. I seek one who calls himself a druid. What do you call yourself, manling?'

You say, 'I call myself a druid'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Good. I had hoped you were one. As nature's guardian, you fight the never-ending struggle against those who seek to defile it. It is an admirable quality and I wish to aid you. I will provide you with a cap, a tunic, sleeves, bracers, gloves, leggings and boots.'

'''After turn-in:'''

Cobi Frostbeard smiles warmly as he hands you your reward. 'You have done well, _____.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Coldain]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Dain Frostreaver IV]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromzek]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Kromrif]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

== Circlet ==

You say, 'What cap?'

: Cobi Frostbeard  says, 'Those who are wise as we are know that protection of the head is the most important. I may be able to forge you something most interesting if you were to bring me three pieces of crushed onyx sapphire and an eroded leather cap.

[[Crushed Onyx Sapphire]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Cap]]s drop from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Tunic ==

You say, 'What tunic?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says, 'If you find an eroded leather tunic and three pieces of black marble bring them to me and I shall attempt to create an enchanted tunic that will serve you well.'

[[Black Marble]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Tunic]] drops from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Sleeves ==

You say, 'What sleeves?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Three jaundice gems and a set of eroded leather sleeves might be an interesting combination.  The powers of the gems may be harvested to imbue the sleeves.'

[[Jaundice Gem|Jaundice Gems]] are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Sleeves]] drops from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Bracers ==

You say, 'What bracers?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Bracers are quite easy to imbue. Simply find three crushed opals and an eroded leather bracer and I will complete the ritual to enchant them.'

[[Crushed Opal]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Bracelet]]s drop from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Gloves ==

You say, 'What gloves?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Strong protection for one's hands is important. I may be able to craft you a set of powerful leather gloves if you find a set of eroded leather gloves and three crushed lava rubies.'

[[Crushed Lava Ruby]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Gloves]] drop from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Leggings ==

You say, 'What leggings?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says, 'Leggings are a bit trickier to imbue. Three chipped onyx sapphires will allow me to channel the correct energies into a pair of eroded leather leggings. However, those chipped onyx sapphires are somewhat rare. Return to me if you find such things in your journeys.'

[[Chipped Onyx Sapphire]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Leggings]] drop from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

== Boots ==

You say, 'What boots?'

: Cobi Frostbeard says 'Simply bring me a set of three crushed flame emeralds and a pair of eroded leather boots and I will imbue them. I bid you good luck in finding such things.'

[[Crushed Flame Emerald]]s are dropped in various Velious zones while [[Eroded Leather Boots]] drop from the higher level giants in Kael Drakkel.

